* Alternative: one common tail (280 um, about 700 uA) with 225 ohm source resistors on a larger 80 um RF pair,
* instead of split tails joined by an RC degeneration network.
.subckt gilbert_mixer vss iref vdd lop lon rfp rfn ifoutp ifoutn
XREF iref iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=20 nf=4
XTAIL tail iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=280 nf=56
CBIAS iref vss 1p
XRFP drfp rfp sp vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.3 w=80 nf=16
XRFN drfn rfn sn vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.3 w=80 nf=16
RSP sp tail 225
RSN sn tail 225
XQ1 ifoutp lop drfp vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=40 nf=10
XQ2 ifoutn lon drfp vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=40 nf=10
XQ3 ifoutn lop drfn vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=40 nf=10
XQ4 ifoutp lon drfn vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=40 nf=10
RLP vdd ifoutp 2.4k
RLN vdd ifoutn 2.4k
COUTP ifoutp vss 50f
COUTN ifoutn vss 50f
.ends gilbert_mixer
